      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What world are you loading into? Take a look at this reddit thread and my response in there.\n\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/VRchat/comments/1q4eree/vrchat_now_loads_me_into_a_random_pub_instead_of/\n\nWell, I'll copy the instructions here.\n\nIn Steams desktop UI go to VRChat, and then go to its properties, and in General (where it opens) take a look at the launch parameters. They should be empty unless you have a reason why.\n\nPersonally I have --enable-sdk-log-levels --midi=circuitpython in mine.\n\nIt's def concerning if your launch parameters have been adjusted without your input.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
