  "details": "Every time I load into VRChat, I load into a world that isn't my home world. It's the same world every time. It doesn't fix if I reset home world or change it. I've also cleared my cache a few times. However, if I click the home world button, it does send me to whatever world I set it as. I just don't like loading into a public server every time. Also, I know this sounds like a support request, which I filled that out first, but it told me to put it here.",
